<title>MOROCCO: Moroccan bourse closed for Throne feast.</title>
<headline>Moroccan bourse closed for Throne feast.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco's stock exchange and banks were closed on Monday for the Throne feast marking the 36th anniversary of King Hassan's enthronement.</p>
<p>They will reopen on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
